  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A balance symptom that is characterized by a disturbance of consciousness characterized by inability to engage in orderly thought or by lack of power to distinguish, choose, or act decisively.</obo:IAO_0000115>
