  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A nutrition, metabolism, and development symptom that is characterized by the unintended loss of weight and lean body tissue characteristic of many diseases (as cancer, tuberculosis, and AIDS).</obo:IAO_0000115>
