  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A neurological and physiological symptom that is characterized by one's body’s ability to sense movement, action, and location and results from sensory receptors in one's nervous system and body (muscles, joints, and tendons).</obo:IAO_0000115>
