  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A feeding difficulties and mismanagement that is characterized by an infant with little interest in feeding and it can also refer to an infant who is not feeding enough to receive the necessary nutrition required for adequate growth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
