  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An alteration of consciousness that is characterized by a lack of critical mental function and a level of consciousness, in which an affected person is almost entirely unresponsive and responds only to intense stimuli such as pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
