  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Faint is a alteration of consciousness characterized by a loss of consciousness because of a temporary decrease in the blood supply to the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
