  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An abdominal pain that is characterized by occurring in the left upper quadrant abdominal pain of the abdomen that can be caused by a stomach ulcer, acute gastritis, a viral infection, or indigestion, or may be an issue with one's lungs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
