  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A urinary system symptom that is characterized by abnormal purulent or mucoid secretions from the penis or, rarely, the female urethra.</obo:IAO_0000115>
