  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tachycardia is a cardiovascular system symptom consisting of a relatively rapid heart action whether physiological (as after exercise) or pathological.</obo:IAO_0000115>
