  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A skin and integumentary tissue symptom that is characterized by a minute reddish or purplish spot containing blood that appears in skin or mucous membrane as a result of localized hemorrhage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
