  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A skin and integumentary tissue symptom that is characterized by a small circumscribed elevation of the skin containing pus and having an inflamed base.</obo:IAO_0000115>
